a:["$","article",null,{"className":"max-w-4xl mx-auto","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted","children":[["$","$L18",null,{"href":"/","className":"hover:text-main transition-colors","children":"Home"}],["$","$L19",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m9 18 6-6-6-6","key":"mthhwq"}]],"className":"lucide-chevron-right w-3.5 h-3.5"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"font-medium text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400","children":"AI Waitlist Rescue"}]]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20 mb-4","children":[["$","$L19",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z","key":"1xq2db"}]],"className":"lucide-zap w-3.5 h-3.5"}],"Waitlist Rescue"]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-main tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4","children":"AI Waitlist Rescue for Indian train travel"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-base sm:text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"Your train is waitlisted, the date is fixed, and refreshing the availability chart is not going to change it. Trayago searches further out — across split journeys and alternative route combinations — for ways to cover the same route where seats may still be available."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L18",null,{"href":"/","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-sm font-bold transition-colors shadow-md","children":[["$","$L19",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m21 21-4.34-4.34","key":"14j7rj"}],["circle",{"cx":"11","cy":"11","r":"8","key":"4ej97u"}]],"className":"lucide-search w-4 h-4"}],"Search alternative routes"]}],["$","$L18",null,{"href":"/pnr","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-card hover:bg-card/80 border border-subtle text-main text-sm font-semibold transition-colors","children":[["$","$L19",null,{"iconNode":[["circle",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10","key":"1mglay"}],["path",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4","key":"dzmm74"}]],"className":"lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500"}],"Check PNR confirmation chance"]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-main mb-4","children":"The problem with a waitlisted ticket"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-main leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"A waitlisted ticket is not a booking — it is a queue position. You hold a place in line and hope enough cancellations happen ahead of you before the chart is prepared. On popular corridors during festival weeks, summer holidays, or a long weekend, the waitlist on a single train can run into the hundreds, and the queue barely moves."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-main leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"What makes it difficult is not the uncertainty alone but the timing. You usually find out where you actually stand only when the chart is prepared, hours before departure — long past the point where you could have arranged something else. Meanwhile the travel date itself is rarely negotiable, because it is set by a wedding, a job interview, a hospital appointment, or the end of a college break."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-main leading-relaxed","children":"The instinct at that point is to keep checking the same train. But the useful question is a different one: is there another way to cover this route on this date?"}]]}],"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22"]}]
